  under the GNU GPL, version 2 or later. See oracle/patches/README.md.
- tools/ghidra/patches/: modifications of Ghidra's decompiler, licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0. See tools/ghidra/patches/README.md.
- analysis/: metadata read from the game's binary (symbol names, addresses, class
  layouts, call-site facts) and verification results. These are facts about the
  program, provided for interoperability and research; no licence is claimed over
